/*
 * Linker script that dev/cross/build puts first on the library path of the
 * glibc builds of the CLI. Rust's std links the GCC unwinder with -lgcc_s,
 * which makes the binary need libgcc_s.so.1 at run time; minimal glibc images
 * such as gcr.io/distroless/base lack it. This script resolves -lgcc_s to the
 * static unwinder libgcc_eh.a of the cross toolchain instead. libgcc.a
 * provides the helpers that libgcc_eh.a calls, such as the outline atomics of
 * aarch64.
 */
GROUP(-lgcc_eh -lgcc)
